.TH GPS 1 2000-1月 "gene_names" "gene_names"
.SH NAME
gene_names \- Get the gene ids of the trained GPS model, in the modelling order.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIgene_names(\fBgps\fR as <generic> GPSModel);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Get the gene ids of the trained GPS model, in the modelling order.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBgps\fB \fR\- the trained model object created by \fBGPS::build_gps\fR or restored by \fBreadBin\fR.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a character vector of the gene id (Ensembl gene id for the human model), the order of
 this vector is the row order of every expression profile produced by the model.
.PP
.SH DETAILS
.PP
The gene order of the model is not necessarily the same as the order of the input
 expression matrix, so any external profile must be aligned against this vector instead of
 against the raw input file.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GPS
.SH FILES
.PP
biosystem.dll
.PP
